gapl(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily through 'Personal Influence'. Your path to success opens up when you learn to confidently express your will, ideas, and uniqueness, inspiring others with your example."},
gapj(){return"Your Archetype finds its most natural expression through 'Personal Influence'. You realize your potential most easily when you act from your 'Self', lead others, and persuade through the power of your charisma. Your path is to be bright, visible, and true to yourself."},
gapk(){return"Your Archetype demands total expression through 'Personal Influence'. Your immense potential can only be unlocked if you embrace the role of a powerful, visible center that leads others. Any attempt to remain in the shadows will be counterproductive."},
gape(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily through 'Intuition and Adaptation'. Your path to success opens up when you develop the ability to intuitively sense the situation and flexibly adjust your actions to the expectations of others."},
gapc(){return"Your Archetype finds its key expression in 'Intuition and Adaptation'. You realize your potential most easily when you trust your 'sixth sense' to understand people and find the most effective approach. Your path is flexibility and creating resonance."},
gapd(){return"Your Archetype demands full expression through 'Intuition and Adaptation'. Your most powerful realization comes from fully trusting your ability to intuitively read people and context. Attempts to act straightforwardly, ignoring this gift, will be ineffective."},
gapa(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily through the 'Power of Mastery'. Your path to success opens up when you focus on honing your skills, letting the quality of your work speak for you."},
gap8(){return"Your Archetype finds its key expression in the 'Power of Mastery'. You realize your potential most easily when you demonstrate undeniable competence and concrete, high-quality results. Your path is professionalism and the pursuit of excellence."},
gap9(){return"Your Archetype demands total realization through the 'Power of Mastery'. Your life requires the focused development of skills to the level of flawless expertise. You will find it easiest if you allow your mastery to speak louder than any words."},
gapt(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily through a balance of 'Personal Influence' and 'Intuition and Adaptation'. Your path to strength lies in learning to support your charisma with a deep understanding of people and situations."},
gapr(){return"Your Archetype finds its main expression in the synergy of 'Personal Influence' and 'Intuition and Adaptation'. You will find it easiest in life when your willful actions are based on a subtle sense of the moment and the audience. This is the path of a leader who not only leads but also listens."},
gaps(){return"Your Archetype demands the full integration of 'Personal Influence' and 'Intuition and Adaptation'. Your most powerful realization lies in the constant search for this dynamic balance. Any assertion of will without considering the context will lead to significant consequences."},
gapp(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily when your work becomes the arena for your 'Personal Influence'. You will find it easiest if your job and your achievements become a natural extension of your charisma and will."},
gapn(){return"Your Archetype is realized through 'Mission and Calling'\u2014a synthesis of 'Personal Influence' and the 'Power of Mastery'. You will find it easiest to achieve success when your 'Self' and your social role become one. Your path is to back up your charisma with real achievements."},
gapo(){return"Your Archetype demands a complete fusion of your personality with your work. For you, there is no separation between who you are and your results. You will find it easiest if you accept as your destiny that your personality and your mastery are a single, powerful flow."},
gapi(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily when you apply 'Intuition and Adaptation' to achieve practical results. You will find it easiest if you trust your 'sixth sense' to choose the right project and hone your mastery."},
gapg(){return"Your Archetype is realized through 'Empathic Mastery'\u2014a synthesis of 'Intuition and Adaptation' and the 'Power of Mastery'. You will find it easiest if you build your path to success by creating products and services that perfectly meet the hidden needs of people, demonstrating the highest quality."},
gaph(){return"Your Archetype demands that 'Intuition and Adaptation' become your primary tool for achieving the 'Power of Mastery'. You will find it easiest in life if you trust your understanding of people as the most accurate navigator on your path to success. Competence without context will be ineffective for you."},
gZ0(){return"Your potential unfolds more easily through the integration of all three channels. You will find it easiest if you strive for a balance between expressing your will ('Personal Influence'), sensing others ('Intuition and Adaptation'), and achieving concrete results ('Power of Mastery')."},
gapv(){return"Your Archetype is realized through the 'Path of Integrity'\u2014the art of dynamic balance. You will find it easiest if you simultaneously use 'Personal Influence', 'Intuition and Adaptation', and the 'Power of Mastery', without giving preference to any one."},
gapw(){return"Your Archetype demands total realization on all three levels. You will find it easiest in life if you embrace this great task\u2014to be a charismatic leader ('Personal Influence'), an intuitive strategist ('Intuition and Adaptation'), and a successful professional ('Power of Mastery'). Ignoring any of these three areas will lead to imbalance."},
