B.aRz=new A.d("To understand astrology as a logical system rather than mysticism, it is necessary to find an appropriate worldview for it. Classical, mechanistic science rightly rejected it, as its picture of the world had no place for non-material connections.",null,B.b,null,null)
B.akm=s([B.aRz],t.n)
B.aRG=new A.d("If the principle of Mercury prevails, the individual's main focus is on the internal processes of thinking, analysis, and cognition. The motivation becomes the need to understand, connect facts, and build logical chains. This is expressed in an inclination towards intellectual activities (scientist, analyst, programmer) and fields where the precise transmission of internally processed information is important (writer, teacher, journalist). The key need is for mental clarity, learning, and constant informational exchange.",null,B.b,null,null)
B.akn=s([B.aRG],t.n)
