B.aO0=new A.d('In the hierarchy of internal processes, ordered by geocentric speed, the Moon is the fastest marker. Its principle logically describes the very first, primary, and pre-conscious stage of interaction with reality\u2014intuitive recognition.\n\nBefore the mind can classify a stimulus, our subconscious (the Moon) instantly "reads" information directly from the [Field], which, as we recall, is endowed with the memory of all past experience. The response from the [Field] comes not in words, but as a holistic feeling, an intuitive image, or a "sixth sense." This intuitive "report" is instantly transmitted to the body, triggering a primary instinctive response along the "safe/dangerous," "mine/not mine" axis.\n\nThus, the Moon is our interface to the memory of the [Field] and the foundation of our intuition. It is responsible for forming habits, subconscious programs, and automatic reactions based on all accumulated experience\u2014both personal and collective. Its physical characteristics confirm this role:',null,B.b,null,null)
