B.aS_=new A.d("A surprising discovery occurred, unexpected even to the author: the attempt to create a working theory of astrology inevitably forced the creation of a working theory of reality. It was the strict requirements of astrological mechanics\u2014cyclicality, fractality, non-locality\u2014that step by step led to the philosophical conclusions presented in this book. It turned out that by starting with the question of planetary motion, we arrived at answers to questions about the nature of consciousness, time, and life itself.",null,B.b,null,null)
