B.b3Y=new A.d('The individual becomes particularly sensitive to this rhythm of transformation of deep-seated attitudes. Their life path may be associated with intensely experiencing the processes of dismantling rigid beliefs, behaviors, or ways of life inherited from the collective past.\n\nThis can manifest in an inclination towards roles requiring interaction with liminal states, crises, and "purification" processes: a crisis manager, a psychotherapist working with deep traumas, a resuscitation surgeon, an investigator, a waste disposal specialist (both literally and figuratively), a researcher of taboo subjects. The key challenge is not to cling to obsolete collective and personal structures, but to consciously participate in the process of their renewal.',null,B.b,null,null)
B.aue=s([B.b3Y],t.n)
