B.aZW=new A.d("To solve this mystery and find the true source of astrology's power, we can no longer repair the old model. We must do what any good researcher does when they hit a dead end: go back to the very beginning.\n\nWe need to rewind the tape thousands of years, before the emergence of gods and psychological interpretations, and see the world through the eyes of the first observer. To understand not what astrology became, but what it was in its essence from the very start.\n\nIt is this step back, to fundamental principles, that we will take in 'Act 2: A Return to the Source.'",null,B.b,null,null)
