B.Xo=new A.d("Compatibility isn\u2019t destiny \u2014 it\u2019s awareness.\nAn MSA analysis doesn\u2019t tell you *whether* you\u2019re right for each other; it shows *how* you meet, learn, and grow together.\n\nHigh resonance and synchronization aren\u2019t guarantees of happiness \u2014 they\u2019re a strong foundation.\nWhat you build on it is your choice.\n\nLow resonance isn\u2019t a curse either \u2014 it just means you\u2019ll need more intention and patience.\nIf both people are conscious and willing, even very different charts can dance beautifully.\n\n",null,B.b,null,null)
